---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>👋 Welcome to My Blog!</h1>
			<p>
				Hi, I'm <strong>Locch</strong>. I write this blog for a simple reason: my mind keeps
				generating things — questions, ideas, half-formed arguments — and I want to write them
				down before I forget them.
			</p>
			<p>
				Because here is what I believe: <strong>if you don't treat your ideas well, they stop
				coming.</strong> An idea you write down, question, and finish invites the next one.
				An idea you ignore quietly leaves. This blog is where I try to treat mine well —
				mostly about AI, software engineering, and how we learn.
			</p>
			<p>Feel free to explore:</p>
			<ul>
				<li><a href="/blogs/blog/">Check out my latest blog posts</a></li>
				<li><a href="/blogs/about/">Learn more about me</a></li>
				<li>Browse through my thoughts on various topics</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Thanks for stopping by! If you'd like to connect or have any questions, 
				feel free to reach out through my social links below.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
